# Repo Type Detection
RULE: Determine repo type before scaffolding. Services: orchestrators with ServiceCLI. Libraries: business logic by tier (0/1/2). UIs: TypeScript with smoke tests, no Python quality gates.
WHY: Different repo types have different setup requirements and quality gates.
CODEX: 05-infrastructure/new-repo-setup.md
DO: Services use ServiceCLI and delegate to libraries; libraries follow tier architecture; UIs use tsc/ESLint only (no uv/basedpyright/pytest)
NEVER: Python quality gates in UI repos; business logic in services; circular imports between Tier 2 libraries
